### PetClinic · Customers (a través del gateway)
### Requiere: gateway en :8080 y customers-service en :8081
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/customers

### 1. Listar tipos de mascota (ordenados por nombre)
GET {{baseUrl}}/petTypes

### 2. Buscar owners por prefijo de apellido (case-insensitive, tamaño 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/owners?lastName=Fra&page=1&size=5

### 3. Página fuera de rango: se sirve la página 1 y se reporta en el payload (ADR-004)
GET {{baseUrl}}/owners?page=99&size=5

### 4. Tamaño inválido: 400 con ProblemDetail
GET {{baseUrl}}/owners?size=500

### 5. Detalle de un owner (incluye mascotas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/owners/1

### 6. Owner inexistente: 404 con ProblemDetail
GET {{baseUrl}}/owners/999

### 7. Crear un owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/owners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "address": "12 Analytical St.",
  "city": "London",
  "telephone": "6000000001"
}

### 8. Validación: teléfono con 9 dígitos → 400 (BR-OWN-05)
POST {{baseUrl}}/owners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "address": "12 Analytical St.",
  "city": "London",
  "telephone": "600000001"
}

### 9. Crear una mascota para el owner 1 (Leo ya existe: usa otro nombre)
POST {{baseUrl}}/owners/1/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada's cat",
  "birthDate": "2020-02-02",
  "typeId": 1
}

### 10. Nombre duplicado en el mismo owner (case-insensitive) → 409 (BR-PET-04)
POST {{baseUrl}}/owners/1/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "leo",
  "birthDate": "2020-02-02",
  "typeId": 1
}

### 11. Fecha de nacimiento futura → 400 (BR-PET-03)
POST {{baseUrl}}/owners/1/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Future pet",
  "birthDate": "2999-01-01",
  "typeId": 1
}

### 12. Actualizar un owner (el id manda desde la URL)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/owners/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "George",
  "lastName": "Franklin",
  "address": "110 W. Liberty St.",
  "city": "Madison",
  "telephone": "6085551023"
}

### 13. Actualizar una mascota omitiendo el tipo (se conserva el actual, BR-PET-02)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/owners/1/pets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leo",
  "birthDate": "2010-09-07"
}
